  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Union Support to Migration Management in Serbia: Improving Reception Capacity, Protection Services and Access to Education - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports Serbian authorities in addressing basic needs of migrant populations residing in Serbia through the improvement of living conditions in reception and asylum centers, procurement of relevant non-food items and personal protective equipment, ensuring access to education for migrant children enrolled in the formal education system, as well ensuring access to protection services through engagement of social protection professionals present in the field, support to their better mobility between locations when necessary, coverage of utility costs of centers dedicated to accommodation of unaccompanied migrant children and purchase of relevant furniture and IT equipment needed in these centers.</narrative>
  </description>
